## Session Flow

<!--
  guidance: This closes the loop back to "Tasks Are the Source of Truth" with a
  concrete, repeatable sequence. New contributors (human or agent) benefit from
  seeing the whole lifecycle in one place rather than assembling it from the rules
  scattered above.
-->

```
Check task list → claim next task (mark in-progress) → do the work →
verify it actually works → mark task complete with a note on what changed
```

For anything bigger than a single task, break it into a task list before writing
any code — a plan reviewed before execution is cheap to correct; code written
against the wrong plan is not.

